collisions 0.09 per life before, 0.08 after.","P-47D Thunderbolt: learned to change fights on damaged (0.5 → 1). Now it dives on the enemy from above when it can, otherwise turn-fights, never breaks off, opens fire at 130% of the usual range, throttles back in turns. Kills per life 0.61 before, 0.56 after; own crashes and collisions 0.08 per life before, 0.09 after.","La-5FN: learned to change firing range (1.15 → 1.3). Now it turn-fights, never breaks off, opens fire at 130% of the usual range, throttles back in turns. Kills per life 0.67 before, 0.73 after; own crashes and collisions 0.14 per life before, 0.14 after.","Ki-43-II Hayabusa: kept its tactics: nothing tried beat the noise. Now it turn-fights, never breaks off, throttles back in turns. Kills per life 0.2 before, 0.2 after; own crashes and collisions 0.09 per life before, 0.08 after.","Brewster B-239: learned to change fires at convergence (1.5 → 2). Now it turn-fights, never breaks off, opens fire at 115% of the usual range, throttles back in turns. Kills per life 0.54 before, 0.62 after; own crashes and collisions 0.1 per life before, 0.09 after.","The kills-per-life numbers are from a short check (every pairing, a few matches), so small changes there can be luck. The Balance Lab run started next shows the effect on the real battle."]}